<title>ITALY: Alitalia launches Internet site.</title>
<headline>Alitalia launches Internet site.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alitalia Cargo said it has opened an Internet home page featuring a wide range of corporate information including air cargo services and facilities, and contact numbers for the airline's offices. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
